&lt;p&gt;KARACHI: The Pakistan LPG Marketers Association has postponed its planned strike after a meeting with Sindh Governor Syed Nehal Hashmi on Monday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The PLPGMA had annou­nced a strike for Nov 16 over the lack of consultation on the LPG policy.&lt;/p&gt;
